{"text": "Just then the generals cook, Prokhor, came by, and Ochumelov called him over to ask about the dog. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is this your dog, Prokhor, he asked, and the cook answered, What an idea, We have never had a dog like that. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then there is no need to ask any more, for it is just a stray dog, and it must be destroyed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is not ours, Prokhor went on, but it belongs to the generals brother, who arrived here the other day and likes borzois. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At these words, Ochumelovs whole face filled with a warm, tender smile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Vladimir Ivanich has come, I did not even know it, So it is his dog, Then take it, by all means. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is a fine, lively little pup, and it snapped at this fellows finger, ha ha ha. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Come now, why are you shaking, you little rascal. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Prokhor called the dog and walked away from the woodyard with it, while the whole crowd laughed at Khryukin. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will deal with you later, Ochumelov warned Khryukin, and wrapping himself in his coat, he went on his way across the market square.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "u", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "e", "n", "e", "r", "a", "l", "s", " ", "c", "o", "o", "k", ",", " ", "P", "r", "o", "k", "h", "o", "r", ",", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "b", "y", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "O", "c", "h", "u", "m", "e", "l", "o", "v", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "o", "v", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "s", "k", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "s", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "d", "o", "g", ",", " ", "P", "r", "o", "k", "h", "o", "r", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "a", "s", "k", "e"